OzOROHJ2-xDIAjdBCP8cg",{"latestBlog":102},[103,106,109,112,115],{"title":104,"slug":105},"港式英语，勉强算英语吧","hongkong-english-accent",{"title":107,"slug":108},"显微镜下的大明之丝绢案","under-the-microscope",{"title":110,"slug":111},"用chatGPT学俄语","chatgpt-teaches-russian",{"title":113,"slug":114},"夏洛克·福尔摩斯和H·H·福尔摩斯：其实没什么关系","sherlock-holmes-and-h-h-holmes",{"title":116,"slug":117},"手疼的时候想到八佰伴","oshin-and-yaohan",{"id":119,"title":120,"body":121,"categories":307,"description":308,"extension":309,"meta":310,"navigation":96,"path":317,"seo":318,"slug":319,"stem":320,"tags":321,"__hash__":324},"blog\u002Fblog\u002F2021-06-26-split-one-to-many-rows-to-one-to-one-rows.md","如何在Excel内将一对多的两列分离成每行都是一对一的两列",{"type":122,"value":123,"toc":299},"minimark",[124,128,132,139,143,146,151,154,159,162,170,175,178,192,195,198,203,210,215,218,223,226,231,242,247,254,259,265,270,277,282,285,290,293,296],[125,126,127],"h2",{"id":127},"分离单元格内多行数据并建立查找关系",[129,130,131],"p",{},"先看看效果",[129,133,134],{},[135,136],"img",{"alt":137,"src":138},"image","https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123504634-39991a80-d68d-11eb-956a-13acfc5ae997.png",[125,140,142],{"id":141},"vlookup的关键字列包含多行数据","vlookup的关键字列包含多行数据？",[129,144,145],{},"假设我们要根据城市名查找省份名，最理想的原数据格式是这样的，用 VLOOKUP 一分钟就搞定。或者如果是左省右市，你自己把省份名复制到城市名右边，最多两分钟搞定。",[129,147,148],{},[135,149],{"alt":137,"src":150},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123506517-24c18480-d697-11eb-931c-a038a7592dfc.png",[129,152,153],{},"但是如果真的这么不幸，天要亡你，同事给了你单行、一对多的原始数据，先别急着跳楼，还有救。",[129,155,156],{},[135,157],{"alt":137,"src":158},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123506907-399f1780-d699-11eb-8d1e-53a57234cff6.png",[125,160,161],{"id":161},"在辅助列补写对应关系",[129,163,164,165,169],{},"我们可以在 C 列建立辅助列，填写公式 ",[166,167,168],"code",{},"=A1&\"-\"&SUBSTITUTE(B1,CHAR(10),CHAR(10)&A1&\"-\")","，然后点击单元格右下角十字按钮下拉填充。",[129,171,172],{},[135,173],{"alt":137,"src":174},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507166-8d5e3080-d69a-11eb-9578-936e104e6008.png",[129,176,177],{},"解释：",[129,179,180,183,184,187,188,191],{},[166,181,182],{},"CHAR(10)"," 是代表单元格内的换行符，我们可以用它来定位需要分离的位置，然后用 ",[166,185,186],{},"SUBSTITUTE"," 函数补足对应的省份名以及分离用的识别符号 ",[166,189,190],{},"-"," 以便下一步操作。",[125,193,194],{"id":194},"将补写好的结果用记事本中转一下",[129,196,197],{},"首先复制 C 列内容",[129,199,200],{},[135,201],{"alt":137,"src":202},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507375-969bcd00-d69b-11eb-833a-bafae28db005.png",[129,204,205,206,209],{},"然后粘贴到空白记事本内，使用 ",[166,207,208],{},"查找和替换"," 功能，把英文的双引号删掉",[129,211,212],{},[135,213],{"alt":137,"src":214},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507432-e8445780-d69b-11eb-982a-83c9e0c34e43.png",[129,216,217],{},"让记事本内变成这样",[129,219,220],{},[135,221],{"alt":137,"src":222},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507448-fc885480-d69b-11eb-9609-818e55bcaf4d.png",[129,224,225],{},"从记事本内复制处理后的数据，再新建一个空白的 Excel 表格，粘贴进去",[129,227,228],{},[135,229],{"alt":137,"src":230},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507490-51c46600-d69c-11eb-89f0-b1eea38da035.png",[129,232,233,234,237,238,241],{},"再点击菜单栏的 ",[166,235,236],{},"数据"," 选项卡，找到 ",[166,239,240],{},"分列"," 按钮",[129,243,244],{},[135,245],{"alt":137,"src":246},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507538-8b956c80-d69c-11eb-82c3-f738ef6893fe.png",[129,248,249,250,253],{},"然后选择使用 ",[166,251,252],{},"分隔符号"," 来分隔",[129,255,256],{},[135,257],{"alt":137,"src":258},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507563-b2ec3980-d69c-11eb-95ec-68ae6469ac7b.png",[129,260,261,262,264],{},"填写 ",[166,263,190],{}," 作为分隔用的符号",[129,266,267],{},[135,268],{"alt":137,"src":269},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507577-d0210800-d69c-11eb-8bc5-702dafc57d22.png",[129,271,272,273,276],{},"数据类型方面，如果不是日期也不是用于计算的数字，建议都选 ",[166,274,275],{},"文本"," ，这样比较安全。",[129,278,279],{},[135,280],{"alt":137,"src":281},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507634-12e2e000-d69d-11eb-8140-d37d9a77e2f3.png",[129,283,284],{},"这样就完成啦！",[129,286,287],{},[135,288],{"alt":137,"src":289},"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-images.githubusercontent.com\u002F30020736\u002F123507662-2c842780-d69d-11eb-8c14-d3dd17f14a6c.png",[125,291,292],{"id":292},"结语",[129,294,295],{},"给数据的人可能是无心的，对方也不知道拿到数据的人会怎么处理。如果你有时间再交涉一遍，让对方重新导出符合要求的数据，那自然是好的。但是如果时间不够了，可以尝试用这个方法来应急。",[129,297,298],{},"全文完~",{"title":300,"searchDepth":34,"depth":34,"links":301},"",[302,303,304,305,306],{"id":127,"depth":34,"text":127},{"id":141,"depth":34,"text":142},{"id":161,"depth":34,"text":161},{"id":194,"depth":34,"text":194},{"id":292,"depth":34,"text":292},[12],"做数据交叉对照查询的时候，如果关键字挤在同一个单元格里，可以先将其分离出来变成多行，再进行查找。","md",{"date":311,"language":312,"keywords":313,"comments":96},"2021-06-26","中文",[314,315,316],"MS Excel","WPS表格","VLOOKUP","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-06-26-split-one-to-many-rows-to-one-to-one-rows",{"title":120,"description":308},"split-one-to-many-rows-to-one-to-one-rows","blog\u002F2021-06-26-split-one-to-many-rows-to-one-to-one-rows",[322,240,323],"Excel","vlookup","_8oH1sFpzYlwhgk7jfQmNtLuithfezlofwEZY8d05AE",[326,331],{"title":327,"path":328,"stem":329,"children":-1,"slug":330},"义字如刀——《手卷烟》影评","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-06-14-hand-rolled-cigarette","blog\u002F2021-06-14-hand-rolled-cigarette","hand-rolled-cigarette",{"title":332,"path":333,"stem":334,"children":-1,"slug":335},"给发烫的手机快速降温","\u002Fblog\u002F2021-08-03-cool-my-phone","blog\u002F2021-08-03-cool-my-phone","cool-my-phone",1794550657041]